  itself follows this principle—that nature identifies systems by structure-preserving
  transformations, while residual automorphisms become observable degrees of freedom. Beautiful,
  plausible, but not yet an empirical theorem.

  So perhaps our work is not to invent the answers. It is to discover that the apparent separate
